{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105193","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105193/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105193/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105193/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105193","id":2982869018,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6R83RY","number":105193,"title":"Fix incorrect mipmap size calculation for uncompressed DDS textures","user":{"login":"Monstrofil","id":8678392,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzgzOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8678392?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil","html_url":"https://github.com/Monstrofil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monstrofil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","color":"446699","default":false,"description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-04-09T13:39:43Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T23:18:21Z","closed_at":"2025-04-09T23:18:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105193","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105193","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105193.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105193.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-09T23:18:10Z"},"body":"Previously, the DDS texture loader incorrectly calculated mipmap dimensions for uncompressed textures when the original dimensions were non-power-of-two.\r\n\r\nFor example, given a 120×120 texture, the expected mipmap chain should be:\r\n    mipmap=0, size=120×120\r\n    mipmap=1, size=60×60\r\n    mipmap=2, size=30×30\r\n    mipmap=3, size=15×15\r\n    mipmap=4, size=7×7\r\n    mipmap=5, size=3×3\r\n    mipmap=6, size=1×1\r\n\r\nBut the loader was producing:\r\n    mipmap=0, size=120×120\r\n    mipmap=1, size=60×60\r\n    mipmap=2, size=30×30\r\n    mipmap=3, size=15×15\r\n    mipmap=4, size=8×8\r\n    mipmap=5, size=4×4\r\n    mipmap=6, size=2×2\r\n\r\nThis commit corrects the logic to properly compute width and height independently at each mip level.\r\n\r\nThe change corresponds to [how the official Microsoft dds loader works](https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXTex/blob/main/DDSTextureLoader/DDSTextureLoader11.cpp#L1082)  / (MIT license).\r\n\r\n\r\nHere are two textures for testing.\r\n[dds_mipmap_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19668019/dds_mipmap_test.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\nFixes #105136. I also added a bit deeper explanation [in comments of the issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105136#issuecomment-2789786371).\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105193/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105193/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}